  "originalQuery": "As a Database Engineer, you are tasked with migrating an on-premises MySQL database to Google Cloud SQL with minimal to zero downtime. Which of the following migration strategies would be the most suitable to achieve this objective while ensuring data consistency?",
  "originalOptions": "A. Set up Cloud SQL as a read replica of the on-premises MySQL database and promote it to primary when ready.<br/>B. Implement a custom dual-write mechanism to write data to both the on-premises MySQL database and Cloud SQL simultaneously.<br/>C. Lift and shift the entire database using a one-time export-import process.<br/>D. Utilize Cloud Dataflow to stream data from the on-premises MySQL database to Cloud SQL in real-time.",
